## If the live demo fails

| Symptom | Fix (≤ 20 s) |
|---|---|
| "Artifacts missing" in red | Rebuilding needs `.venv/bin/python app/build_artifacts.py`; do not do it live, go to the fallback. |
| Port 8501 busy | `.venv/bin/streamlit run app/streamlit_app.py --server.port 8502` |
| Page blank or spinning | Reload once; if still blank, go to the fallback. |
| No laptop or projector issue | Fallback only. |

**Fallback (no live app):** show the backup slide **"Demo fallback: what FlavorPrint shows"** in `slides.pptx`
(it is generated from the same values as this script) and narrate the three cases:
